# Data platform boundary

## data/ usage

- data/sample/ may contain small simulated CSV fixtures
- data/raw/ is staging and should not store committed real payloads
- data/processed/ is intermediate output and is not for large commits
- data/external/ is reference material and should be gitignored by default

## data_store/ usage

- data_store/ is for local real market data
- Do not commit real parquet, csv, or json market data files
- Keep only placeholder files like .gitkeep in git when needed

## Expected real minute path

- data_store/quotes/minute/MO/{symbol}/{trade_date}.parquet

## Downloader boundary

- Do not implement downloader logic unless current Issue explicitly allows it
- Do not keep downloader output as permanent files under data/raw/

